How can I generate a title for a book summary in Swift that incorporates the constraint that the protagonist, John, must keep his time traveling a secret from everyone, including his loved ones? 
As a starting point, here's the Swift code I've been using to generate potential book titles:
let titleWords = ["Chrono", "Temporal", "Anachronistic", "Timeless", "Era", "Ticking", "Time", "Timewalker", "Chronicles", "Chronicles of"]
let locationWords = ["Secrets", "Mystery", "Lost", "Forgotten", "Hidden", "Enigma", "Unknown"]
let nameWords = ["John", "Jonathan", "Jack", "Jacob", "Jules", "James", "Justin"]
var titles: [String] = []
for i in titleWords {
    for j in locationWords {
        for k in nameWords {
            var title = "\(i) \(j) of \(k)"
            if k == "John" {
                title += " (Secret Time Traveler)"
